# D3-CO-004: Curdling is different from making milk less opaque by dilution
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 whole_milk 30g
add v1 CH3COOH 0.003mol
add v2 whole_milk 30g
add v2 water 30mL
add v3 whole_milk 30g
look v1
look v2
look v3
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
inspect
